ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-6.12.0-211.22.1.el10_2/2d671726.failed

In addition to style changes, rename set_enabled() to lsm_enabled_set()
and is_enabled() to lsm_is_enabled() to better fit within the LSM
initialization code.

